Tue Nov 24 13:19:36 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 2.4.0:
  * Notebooks tools for Grafana 13.3 notebooks preview: list,
    search, get, render as PDF, create, update and delete
  * AWS X-Ray tools in opt-in `xray` category and Azure Monitor
    tools in opt-in `azuremonitor` category
  * `render_grafana_app` gains `query_datasource` source with
    Grafana visualization Renderer for MCP Apps hosts
  * Empty Prometheus and Loki results name the likely cause with
    a stable `hints.reason`
  * New `--config` YAML file for tool selection,
    `--enable-write-tools` keep list, per-user
    `--require-user-credentials` mode, `--log-tool-calls` and
    `--server-auth-header`
  * Prometheus enforced matchers, opt-in TSDB cardinality check,
    `--dashboard-schema=v2` handling and Loki `format: loki`
    output
  * Fix time ranges with only an end time, alerting routing,
    rules and contact-point fixes, library panel queries and
    CloudWatch series merging; bad arguments return clear
    errors instead of panics
  * Breaking: `alerting_rules_read` returns `{rules, truncated,
    next_cursor}` and `query_cloudwatch` nests results under
    `series`; default `--grafana-timeout` rises from 10s to 30s
  * Build with Go 1.26.11 and refreshed `golang.org/x/crypto`

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Nov 11 15:15:17 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Initial package for version 2.3.0
- Add mcp-grafana-usage-stats-opt-in.patch: anonymous usage
  statistics to stats.grafana.org are sent only after an explicit
  --usage-stats=enabled or GRAFANA_USAGE_STATS=enabled
- Build with Go 1.26 as upstream does: Go 1.27 TLS ClientHellos are
  reset by F5 BIG-IP and Palo Alto middleboxes (golang/go#81199)

